{"version": 2, "width": 108, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1794905548, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}, "title": "silent layer \u2014 the contradiction gate"}
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[1msilent layer \u2014 a deliberation layer and contradiction gate for agents\r\n\u001b[2m\r\nthe same tools you saw a moment ago, on a design with a hidden conflict\r\n\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\u25b8 1  an agent reasons: gamify the tracker, but never shame the user\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.369, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo seed a habit tracker that gamifies daily tasks\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.815, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo branch t0 the one committed act at its center\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.261, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo branch t0 what it must never become: no shaming\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.717, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo link t1 t0 needs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.164, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo link t2 t0 needs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.612, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo name t1 committed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.101, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo name t2 musts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.554, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo hold t2 guard: never shame the user\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.012, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo contradict t1 t2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.436, "o", "[tension] t1 <> t2  (held, not resolved)\r\n"]
[4.467, "o", "\u001b[2m              ...i.e. 'streak pressure' and 'never shame' are in tension.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.723, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\u25b8 2  the field sees the conflict (a first-class object, not a vibe)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.081, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo field\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.51, "o", "=== FIELD (salience; config contradict_charge=0.5;execution_fail_floor=0.1;e\u2026) ===\r\n  OPEN CONTRADICTIONS (unresolved \u2014 these block incarnation):\r\n    t1 <> t2  ripen=0  prox=0.0\r\n=== SALIENCE (auditable; weights in SalienceConfig) ===\r\n    t2  1.85  [conflict 1.00  ref 0.00  recency 0.55  prox 1.00  mass 0.30]\r\n    t1  1.65  [conflict 1.00  ref 0.00  recency 0.50  prox 1.00  mass 0.00]\r\n    t0  1.33  [conflict 0.00  ref 1.00  recency 0.46  prox 1.00  mass 0.00]\r\n  proximities (felt closeness):\r\n    t0 ~ t2  0.4\r\n    t0 ~ t1  0.4\r\n    t1 ~ t2  0.4\r\n  heavies (resist collapse):\r\n    t2  mass=1.6\r\n  the silence leans toward:\r\n    > link t0 t2 resonates   (felt proximity 0.4)\r\n    > link t1 t2 resonates   (felt proximity 0.4)\r\n    > link t0 t1 resonates   (felt proximity 0.4)\r\n"]
[5.541, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\u25b8 3  the agent marks it READY \u2014 and the gate refuses to ship it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.897, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo ready t0 t1 t2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.353, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 forge.py from-substrate gate-demo --name gate-demo__incarnated\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.796, "o", "DESIGN FLAWS FOUND -- the word cannot become flesh yet:\r\n  [manual:tension] t1 <> t2 (ripen=0) -- unresolved contradiction\r\n[BLOCKED] the slice holds an open contradiction. Resolve it (substrate resolve) or let it go dormant first.\r\n"]
[6.837, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\u25b8 4  resolve it honestly, then commit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.195, "o", "\u001b[2m$ python3 substrate.py gate-demo resolve t1 t2 the act IS the never \u2014 one promise a day is the anti-shame\u001b[0m\r\n"]
